posts.body:
Greetings everyone!
I recently posted a video on my really small channel at Youtube. It's about a private project I've worked in for quite some time now and I really want some opinions, feedback and share this work with other Final Fantasy Fans.
My Project Video on Youtube
My Channel
I will be very happy to receive ANY feedback!
Final Fantasy Tactics VX ACE
​
SECTION A: SYNOPSIS
Spoiler
The project is a "Remake" (I don't know if "Remake"would be suitable, though) of Final Fantasy Tactics using the classic FF battle style, all done in the RPG Maker VX Ace;
This remake Project has absolutely no profit motivations;
There are many elements from all Final Fantasy;
The storyline is the same as the original game with some sidequests added;
Chapter 1 is likely to be near 100% complete (hopefully
);
Tried to use the most classic abilities and mechanics like Mix, Jump, Blue Magic, Throw, Steal, Summon, Sing, Dance and well as specific mechanics from FFT like Iaido, Geomancy, Sky/Nether Mantra and Charged Abilities;
